      "label": "kizuna_language_d_14",
      "hash64": "C77C0965D90985A5",
      "text": "[VAR 0xBD06(0000)]Oh, my dear [VAR 0x0100(0000)]! Merci\\nso\\r\\nvery,\\r\\nvery\\r\\nmuch\\r\\nfor\\r\\nall\\r\\nyour\\r\\nhelp\\r\\nwith Pawmi![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
